WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Welcome to the recycling service.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Your bin collection day has changed from Monday to Thursday.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Please put your bin out by seven in the morning.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Thank you for recycling.
